---A single line-level entry in a diff hunk. Each DiffChange describes one line and its change type: unchanged context, an addition in the after blob, or a deletion from the before blob.
---@class aws.codecommit.DiffChange
---@field type? aws.codecommit.DiffChangeType The type of change for this line. Possible values:
---@field beforeLineNumber? aws.codecommit.LineNumber The 1-based line number in the before blob. This field is omitted for ADD lines.
---@field afterLineNumber? aws.codecommit.LineNumber The 1-based line number in the after blob. This field is omitted for DELETE lines.
---@field content? aws.codecommit.LineContent The text content of the line, without the trailing newline.

---@alias aws.codecommit.DiffChangeList aws.codecommit.DiffChange[]

---@alias aws.codecommit.DiffChangeType "CONTEXT"|"ADD"|"DELETE"

---@alias aws.codecommit.DiffContext number

---A contiguous run of changed lines from a blob diff, together with any surrounding unchanged context lines. Hunks are returned in order from the start of the file to the end. Adjacent or overlapping hunks are merged into a single hunk in the response.
---@class aws.codecommit.DiffHunk
---@field beforeStartLine? aws.codecommit.LineNumber The 1-based line number in the before blob where this hunk begins. When the hunk consists entirely of additions, beforeLineCount is 0.
---@field beforeLineCount? aws.codecommit.Count The number of lines from the before blob covered by this hunk, including any context lines.
---@field afterStartLine? aws.codecommit.LineNumber The 1-based line number in the after blob where this hunk begins. When the hunk consists entirely of deletions, afterLineCount is 0.
---@field afterLineCount? aws.codecommit.Count The number of lines from the after blob covered by this hunk, including any context lines.
---@field changes? aws.codecommit.DiffChangeList An ordered list of line-level changes that make up this hunk. Each entry indicates whether the line is unchanged context, an addition, or a deletion.

---@alias aws.codecommit.DiffHunkList aws.codecommit.DiffHunk[]

