---@field afterBlob? aws.codecommit.BlobMetadata Information about an afterBlob data type object, including the ID, the file mode permission code, and the path.
---@field changeType? aws.codecommit.ChangeTypeEnum Whether the change type of the difference is an addition (A), deletion (D), or modification (M).

